Error: SHELLCHECK_WARNING (CWE-563):
/usr/bin/batch:6:1: warning[SC2034]: prefix appears unused. Verify use (or export if used externally).
#    4|   	exit 1
#    5|   fi
#    6|-> prefix=/usr
#    7|   exec_prefix=/usr
#    8|   exec /usr/bin/at -qb now
The wrapper only execs /usr/bin/at with a hard-coded path, so prefix is a leftover of the configure-substituted template and is never read.

